{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37451","headline":"东韦曲野思 · 唐彦谦","name":"东韦曲野思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淡雾轻云匝四垂，绿塘秋望独颦眉。\n野莲随水无人见，寒鹭窥鱼共影知。\n九陌要津劳目击，五湖闲梦诱心期。\n孤灯夜夜愁欹枕，一觉沧洲似昔时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}